  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining App\'s Scope**\n\nI\'ve scoped out the project, *CaptionDrive*, focusing on AI-powered content management for Google Drive. We\'re talking captions and content generation for photos and videos, targeting social media users. It\'s built on a foundation of Google Drive, using `workspace-integration` and `gemini-api` skills.\n\n\n**Targeting Ideal User**\n\nI\'ve been thinking about the target users: content creators, influencers, small businesses, agencies, and coaches. The focus now is nailing down the MVP features. I\'m prioritizing user authentication, Google Drive connection with secure OAuth, and an AI media library for imported media. I need to make the user onboarding intuitive, especially the \"Connect your Drive\" flow.\n\n\n**Developing Media Analysis**\n\nI\'m now focusing on detailed media analysis. I\'m building out AI Vision for images, including main subject identification, object detection, and scene analysis. For videos, the AI will generate speech transcripts and key talking points. These analyses will be neatly displayed in a side panel within each media detail, ready for the user\'s consumption.\n\\n\\n\n**Caption Generation Refinement**\n\nThe caption generation is also shaping up. I\'m adding options for a variety of caption styles and user-tailored settings, including platform, tone, and audience. I\'m particularly focused on generating three distinct caption variations, each with a hook, main caption, CTA, and relevant hashtags. I\'ll provide interactive buttons like \"Copy Caption\", \"Regenerate\", and \"Edit Caption\".\n\n\n**Adding Core Features**\n\nI\'m now integrating crucial features. There is a planned in-place media editor. There will be options to share/save content history. Smart AI visual search is coming, allowing natural language queries. I\'m adding a \"Favorites\" option for quick media access, and a complete caption history view. A sidebar navigation system with dashboard metrics, and a modern aesthetic is being refined.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 988074284
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
