    thinking: "**Defining Application Types**\n\nI\'m now creating `/src/types.ts` to define the essential interfaces and data models for this application. The `User` interface includes fields for ID, name, email, avatar, connection status, and connected drive email. Additionally, `MediaType` will be a union type for \'image\' and \'video\', and `MediaItem`\'s structure is being defined, which will include its ID.\n\n\n**Expanding Media Item Details**\n\nI\'m currently fleshing out the `MediaItem` interface with more granular details. I\'ve added properties for drive file ID, filename, file type, mime type, thumbnail, web view link, download URL, folder, uploaded timestamp, formatted size, and duration (for videos). Also adding AI analysis results.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 864131699
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
