  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Key Milestones**\n\nI\'ve just finished reviewing the completed steps. I updated the `metadata.json` file with the app name \"CaptionDrive\" and a proper description. I set up OAuth for Google Drive using the `drive.readonly` scope, ensuring restricted access. Also, I created the server-side backend with Express and integrated the Gemini `@google/genai` SDK.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed building **CaptionDrive**, a modern SaaS web application designed to help creators turn Google Drive media into social media captions with Gemini AI.\n\n### Key Highlights & Features\n\n- **Google Drive Integration**:\n  - Configured OAuth scope (`drive.readonly`) with Google Drive API endpoints.\n  - Automatically scans images and videos from Google Drive with pre-seeded sample media for instant evaluation.\n- **Multimodal Gemini AI Content Analysis**:\n  - **Images**: Automatically detects main subject, key objects, scene setting, emotional mood, color palette, and generates a visual summary.\n  - **Videos**: Extracts speech transcripts, key talking points, and suggests optimal thumbnail timestamps.\n- **AI Caption Generator**:\n  - Tailors content for target platforms (**Instagram**, **LinkedIn**, **Facebook**, **X**).\n  - Supports custom tones (**Storytelling**, **Educational**, **Promotional**, **Inspirational**, **Professional**, **Casual**, **Humorous**), length preferences, and target audience targeting.\n  - Generates **3 distinct caption variations** per request, each featuring a scroll-stopping hook, body copy, call-to-action (CTA), and hashtag recommendations.\n  - Includes one-click copy to clipboard, inline text editing, and history bookmarking.\n- **Smart AI Visual Search**:\n  - Performs natural language queries across visual content (e.g., *\"Show my beach photos\"*, *\"Find videos about AI\"*, *\"Pictures with laptops\"*).\n- **Favorites & History Management**:\n  - Bookmark media assets into Favorites for quick access.\n  - Maintained history of generated captions with search, platform filtering, and copy/delete actions."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 400910657
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
