\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z\\\"/></svg>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"p-2 text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-600\\\"><svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M15 17h5l-1.405-1.405A2.032 2.032 0 0118 14.158V11a6.002 6.002 0 00-4-5.659V5a2 2 0 10-4 0v.341C7.67 6.165 6 8.388 6 11v3.159c0 .538-.214 1.055-.595 1.436L4 17h5m6 0v1a3 3 0 11-6 0v-1m6 0H9\\\"/></svg></button>\\n        <button class=\\\"bg-indigo-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-indigo-700\\\">Sync Drive</button>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <!-- Content Split -->\\n    <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <!-- Library Grid -->\\n      <section class=\\\"w-3/5 p-8 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar border-r border-[#EBECEF]\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-6\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold\\\">Recent Media</h2>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-2\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"p-1.5 bg-gray-100 rounded text-gray-600\\\"><svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M4 6h16M4 10h16M4 14h16M4 18h16\\\"/></svg></button>\\n            <button class=\\\"p-1.5 text-gray-400\\\"><svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M4 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM14 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM4 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2zM14 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2z\\\"/></svg></button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-6\\\">\\n          <!-- Media Card Active -->\\n          <div class=\\\"group relative bg-white border-2 border-indigo-600 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"aspect-video bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center relative\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url(\'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499750310107-5fef28a66643?w=400&auto=format\')] bg-cover bg-center\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute top-2 right-2 bg-indigo-600 p-1 rounded-full\\\">\\n                <svg class=\\\"w-3 h-3 text-white\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\"><path fill-rule=\\\"evenodd\\\" d=\\\"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z\\\" clip-rule=\\\"evenodd\\\"/></svg>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"p-3\\\">\\n              <p class=\\\"text-sm font-bold truncate\\\">Creative_Workspace_Hero.png</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-500\\\">Apr 12, 2024 \342\200\242 Workspace Photos</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <!-- Media Card -->\\n          <div class=\\\"group relative bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-indigo-300 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"aspect-video bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url(\'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517694712202-14dd9538aa97?w=400&auto=format\')] bg-cover bg-center\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center text-white\\\">\\n                <svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\"><path d=\\\"M6.3 2.841A1.5 1.5 0 004 4.11v11.78a1.5 1.5 0 002.3 1.269l9.344-5.89a1.5 1.5 0 000-2.538L6.3 2.84z\\\"/></svg>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"p-3\\\">\\n              <p class=\\\"text-sm font-medium truncate\\\">AI_Tech_Keynote_Short.mp4</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-500\\\">Apr 10, 2024 \342\200\242 Event Footage</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <!-- Media Card -->\\n          <div class=\\\"group relative bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"aspect-video bg-gray-200\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url(\'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504868584819-f8eec4b6d730?w=400&auto=format\')] bg-cover bg-center\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"p-3\\\">\\n              <p class=\\\"text-sm font-medium truncate\\\">Beach_Vlog_01.jpg</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-500\\\">Apr 09, 2024 \342\200\242 Vlog Assets</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <!-- Media Card -->\\n          <div class=\\\"group relative bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"aspect-video bg-gray-200\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url(\'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486312338219-ce68d2c6f44d?w=400&auto=format\')] bg-cover bg-center\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"p-3\\\">\\n              <p class=\\\"text-sm font-medium truncate\\\">Macbook_Detail.png</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-500\\\">Apr 05, 2024 \342\200\242 Product Shots</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- AI Analysis Panel -->\\n      <aside class=\\\"flex-1 bg-gray-50/80 p-8 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-indigo-600\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4 animate-pulse\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\"><path fill-rule=\\\"evenodd\\\" d=\\\"M11.3 1.046A1 1 0 0112 2v5h4a1 1 0 01.82 1.573l-7 10A1 1 0 018 18v-5H4a1 1 0 01-.82-1.573l7-10a1 1 0 011.12-.38z\\\" clip-rule=\\\"evenodd\\\"/></svg>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">AI Content Analysis</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed bg-white border border-gray-200 p-3 rounded-lg shadow-sm\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"font-bold text-gray-900\\\">Summary:</span> Modern laptop on a clean desk with coffee and warm natural lighting. Minimalist aesthetic, tech-focused, productive mood.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-5 shadow-sm space-y-4\\\">\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase text-gray-400\\\">Caption Settings</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-500 block mb-1\\\">Platform</label>\\n              <select class=\\\"w-full text-xs border-gray-200 rounded p-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500\\\">\\n                <option>Instagram</option>\\n                <option>LinkedIn</option>\\n                <option>X</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-500 block mb-1\\\">Tone</label>\\n              <select class=\\\"w-full text-xs border-gray-200 rounded p-2\\\">\\n                <option>Inspirational</option>\\n                <option>Professional</option>\\n                <option>Funny</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <button class=\\\"w-full py-2.5 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-lg text-sm font-bold shadow-lg shadow-indigo-200 hover:bg-indigo-700\\\">Generate Captions</button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-4 overflow-y-auto pr-2\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-indigo-600 shadow-sm\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start mb-2\\\">\\n              <span class=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 text-[10px] font-bold rounded uppercase\\\">Variation 1</span>\\n              <button class=\\\"text-gray-300 hover:text-indigo-600\\\">\\n                <svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M8 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-1M8 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M8 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m0 0h2a2 2 0 012 2v3m2 4H10m0 0l3-3m-3 3l3 3\\\"/></svg>\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-xs text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-3\\\">\\n              \\\"The best way to predict the future is to create it.\\\" \342\234\250 Transforming coffee and code into reality today. #WorkFromAnywhere #TechLife\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 opacity-60\\\">\\n             <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start mb-2\\\">\\n              <span class=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-gray-100 text-gray-500 text-[10px] font-bold rounded uppercase\\\">Variation 2</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-xs text-gray-800 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n              Another day, another workspace layout. How do you stay focused when the sun\'s out? \342\230\225\357\270\217\360\237\222\273 #Productivity #Minimalism\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Professional Polish\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Professional Polish\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"flex h-screen w-full bg-[#FBFBFC] text-[#1A1A1B] font-sans overflow-hidden select-none\\\">\\n  <!-- Sidebar Navigation -->\\n  <aside class=\\\"w-64 border-r border-[#EBECEF] bg-white flex flex-col h-full\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"p-6 flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-white\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-8l-4-4m0 0L8 8m4-4v12\\\"/></svg>\\n      </div>\\n      <span class=\\\"font-bold text-xl tracking-tight text-gray-900\\\">CaptionDrive</span>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <nav class=\\\"flex-1 px-4 space-y-1\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 bg-gray-100 rounded-lg\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6\\\"/></svg>\\n        Dashboard\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-50 rounded-lg\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M4 7v10c0 2 1 3 3 3h10c2 0 3-1 3-3V7c0-2-1-3-3-3H7c-2 0-3 1-3 3z\\\"/><path d=\\\"M8 4v4m8-4v4m-4-4v4\\\"/></svg>\\n        My Media\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-50 rounded-lg\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M11.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.519 4.674a1 1 0 00.95.69h4.915c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-3.976 2.888a1 1 0 00-.363 1.118l1.518 4.674c.3.922-.755 1.688-1.538 1.118l-3.976-2.888a1 1 0 00-1.176 0l-3.976 2.888c-.783.57-1.838-.197-1.538-1.118l1.518-4.674a1 1 0 00-.363-1.118l-3.976-2.888c-.784-.57-.382-1.81.588-1.81h4.914a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.519-4.674z\\\"/></svg>\\n        Favorites\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-50 rounded-lg\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\\\"/></svg>\\n        Recent Captions\\n      </a>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"p-4 border-t border-gray-100\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4 p-2\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-blue-700\\\">JD</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs font-semibold\\\">Jane Designer</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-400\\\">Pro Plan</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg p-3\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-indigo-600 font-bold uppercase mb-1\\\">Drive Sync</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-full bg-indigo-200 rounded-full h-1.5 mb-2\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-indigo-600 h-1.5 rounded-full\\\" style=\\\"width: 65%\\\"></div>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-indigo-700\\\">842 MB of 2 GB used</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </aside>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Viewport -->\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col min-w-0 bg-white\\\">\\n    <!-- Top Header -->\\n    <header class=\\\"h-16 border-b border-[#EBECEF] px-8 flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 max-w-md\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"relative\\\">\\n          <input type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Smart Search: \'beach photos with laptop\'\\\" class=\\\"w-full bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-full py-2 pl-10 pr-4 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500/20 transition-all\\\">\\n          <svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4 absolute left-3.5 top-2.5 text-gray-400\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z\\\"/></svg>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"p-2 text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-600\\\"><svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M15 17h5l-1.405-1.405A2.032 2.032 0 0118 14.158V11a6.002 6.002 0 00-4-5.659V5a2 2 0 10-4 0v.341C7.67 6.165 6 8.388 6 11v3.159c0 .538-.214 1.055-.595 1.436L4 17h5m6 0v1a3 3 0 11-6 0v-1m6 0H9\\\"/></svg></button>\\n        <button class=\\\"bg-indigo-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-indigo-700\\\">Sync Drive</button>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <!-- Content Split -->\\n    <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <!-- Library Grid -->\\n      <section class=\\\"w-3/5 p-8 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar border-r border-[#EBECEF]\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-6\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold\\\">Recent Media</h2>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-2\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"p-1.5 bg-gray-100 rounded text-gray-600\\\"><svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M4 6h16M4 10h16M4 14h16M4 18h16\\\"/></svg></button>\\n            <button class=\\\"p-1.5 text-gray-400\\\"><svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M4 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM14 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM4 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2zM14 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2z\\\"/></svg></button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-6\\\">\\n          <!-- Media Card Active -->\\n          <div class=\\\"group relative bg-white border-2 border-indigo-600 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"aspect-video bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center relative\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url(\'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499750310107-5fef28a66643?w=400&auto=format\')] bg-cover bg-center\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute top-2 right-2 bg-indigo-600 p-1 rounded-full\\\">\\n                <svg class=\\\"w-3 h-3 text-white\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\"><path fill-rule=\\\"evenodd\\\" d=\\\"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z\\\" clip-rule=\\\"evenodd\\\"/></svg>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"p-3\\\">\\n              <p class=\\\"text-sm font-bold truncate\\\">Creative_Workspace_Hero.png</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-500\\\">Apr 12, 2024 \342\200\242 Workspace Photos</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <!-- Media Card -->\\n          <div class=\\\"group relative bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-indigo-300 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"aspect-video bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url(\'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517694712202-14dd9538aa97?w=400&auto=format\')] bg-cover bg-center\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center text-white\\\">\\n                <svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\"><path d=\\\"M6.3 2.841A1.5 1.5 0 004 4.11v11.78a1.5 1.5 0 002.3 1.269l9.344-5.89a1.5 1.5 0 000-2.538L6.3 2.84z\\\"/></svg>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"p-3\\\">\\n              <p class=\\\"text-sm font-medium truncate\\\">AI_Tech_Keynote_Short.mp4</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-500\\\">Apr 10, 2024 \342\200\242 Event Footage</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <!-- Media Card -->\\n          <div class=\\\"group relative bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"aspect-video bg-gray-200\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url(\'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504868584819-f8eec4b6d730?w=400&auto=format\')] bg-cover bg-center\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"p-3\\\">\\n              <p class=\\\"text-sm font-medium truncate\\\">Beach_Vlog_01.jpg</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-500\\\">Apr 09, 2024 \342\200\242 Vlog Assets</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <!-- Media Card -->\\n          <div class=\\\"group relative bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"aspect-video bg-gray-200\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url(\'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486312338219-ce68d2c6f44d?w=400&auto=format\')] bg-cover bg-center\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"p-3\\\">\\n              <p class=\\\"text-sm font-medium truncate\\\">Macbook_Detail.png</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-500\\\">Apr 05, 2024 \342\200\242 Product Shots</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- AI Analysis Panel -->\\n      <aside class=\\\"flex-1 bg-gray-50/80 p-8 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-indigo-600\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4 animate-pulse\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\"><path fill-rule=\\\"evenodd\\\" d=\\\"M11.3 1.046A1 1 0 0112 2v5h4a1 1 0 01.82 1.573l-7 10A1 1 0 018 18v-5H4a1 1 0 01-.82-1.573l7-10a1 1 0 011.12-.38z\\\" clip-rule=\\\"evenodd\\\"/></svg>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">AI Content Analysis</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed bg-white border border-gray-200 p-3 rounded-lg shadow-sm\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"font-bold text-gray-900\\\">Summary:</span> Modern laptop on a clean desk with coffee and warm natural lighting. Minimalist aesthetic, tech-focused, productive mood.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-5 shadow-sm space-y-4\\\">\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase text-gray-400\\\">Caption Settings</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-500 block mb-1\\\">Platform</label>\\n              <select class=\\\"w-full text-xs border-gray-200 rounded p-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500\\\">\\n                <option>Instagram</option>\\n                <option>LinkedIn</option>\\n                <option>X</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-500 block mb-1\\\">Tone</label>\\n              <select class=\\\"w-full text-xs border-gray-200 rounded p-2\\\">\\n                <option>Inspirational</option>\\n                <option>Professional</option>\\n                <option>Funny</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <button class=\\\"w-full py-2.5 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-lg text-sm font-bold shadow-lg shadow-indigo-200 hover:bg-indigo-700\\\">Generate Captions</button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-4 overflow-y-auto pr-2\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-indigo-600 shadow-sm\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start mb-2\\\">\\n              <span class=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 text-[10px] font-bold rounded uppercase\\\">Variation 1</span>\\n              <button class=\\\"text-gray-300 hover:text-indigo-600\\\">\\n                <svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M8 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-1M8 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M8 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m0 0h2a2 2 0 012 2v3m2 4H10m0 0l3-3m-3 3l3 3\\\"/></svg>\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-xs text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-3\\\">\\n              \\\"The best way to predict the future is to create it.\\\" \342\234\250 Transforming coffee and code into reality today. #WorkFromAnywhere #TechLife\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 opacity-60\\\">\\n             <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start mb-2\\\">\\n              <span class=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-gray-100 text-gray-500 text-[10px] font-bold rounded uppercase\\\">Variation 2</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-xs text-gray-800 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n              Another day, another workspace layout. How do you stay focused when the sun\'s out? \342\230\225\357\270\217\360\237\222\273 #Productivity #Minimalism\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
