    thinking: "**Initiating Social Publishing**\n\nI\'m starting the integration of the \"Social Publishing\" navigation item into `Sidebar.tsx`. I\'m thinking of using the `Share2` or `Send` icon for it, and adding a badge to indicate the \"Approval Queue.\" I\'ve also decided to begin creating the necessary components: `SocialPublishView.tsx` and `SocialPublishModal.tsx`.\n\n\n**Designing Social Publishing View**\n\nI\'m now diving into the design of `SocialPublishView.tsx`. I\'ve outlined the sections: header with account connections (platform icons, connection status), a queue for approvals (pending, approved, published) with clear approval requirements, and the post preview layout. Crucially, I\'m integrating live posting simulation/integration within the workflow, with actions to approve/schedule posts and allow caption edits. I\'m also including options to approve and schedule, edit or reject and delete posts.\n\n\n"
