      nanos: 576640590
    }
  }
  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Initial Implementation**\n\nI\'m currently reviewing the initial implementation regarding social media account connections. I\'ve clearly outlined the necessary credentials and setup required to interface with real platform APIs, specifically focusing on Meta. The aim is to ensure a smooth, user-friendly connection process.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have updated the application to support **real social media OAuth connections** and refined the entire **visual design into a clean, monochromatic slate theme**:\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\224\221 Connecting Real Social Media Accounts\n\nTo publish posts directly to your actual social accounts via official developer APIs, here is what is required:\n\n#### 1. Platform Developer Applications\nEach platform requires registering a Developer Application on their respective console:\n- **Meta / Instagram Graph API**: Register an app on [developers.facebook.com](https://developers.facebook.com) with Instagram Content Publishing & Pages permissions.\n- **LinkedIn Developer Portal**: Register an app on [linkedin.com/developers](https://www.linkedin.com/developers) with the `w_member_social` permission.\n- **X / Twitter Developer Portal**: Create a project on [developer.twitter.com](https://developer.twitter.com) with Read and Write permissions.\n- **Facebook Pages API**: Generate a Page Access Token with `pages_manage_posts` access.\n\n#### 2. OAuth Callback Redirect URIs\nIn your platform developer app settings, register these exact callback URLs:\n- **Development Callback URL:** `https://ais-dev-tnvpxywu3hj6b23o4pyogn-479911484194.europe-west2.run.app/api/social/oauth/callback`\n- **Shared / Deployed Callback URL:** `https://ais-pre-tnvpxywu3hj6b23o4pyogn-479911484194.europe-west2.run.app/api/social/oauth/callback`\n\n#### 3. In-App Credentials & OAuth Popup Flow\n- **OAuth API Keys Modal**: Click **\"OAuth API Keys\"** in the Social Publishing view to paste your platform **Client ID** and **Client Secret**.\n- **OAuth Authorization Popup**: Clicking **\"OAuth Popup\"** opens a dedicated popup authorization window directly to the provider (LinkedIn, Meta, Twitter), exchanging tokens safely via cross-origin messaging.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\216\250 Visual Redesign & Aesthetic Refinement\n\n- **Monochromatic Slate Canvas**: Replaced loud multi-color gradients with a clean, high-contrast slate theme with subtle 1px borders (`border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800`).\n- **Unified Accent Color**: Consolidated interface actions around a single indigo accent (`indigo-600`), removing distracting rainbow tags and glowing gradients.\n- **Refined Typography & Cards**: Clean, scannable metric cards, structured headers, and crisp padding to keep focus on media management and caption editing."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 62330742
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
