  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Design Improvement**\n\nI\'m now focused on understanding the user\'s request. My current aim is to dissect the prompt\'s call for app design improvements. I am interpreting the prompt\'s intentions, by breaking it down into component parts, which I can then address.\n\n\n**Clarifying Request Intent**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the user\'s explicit request for app design suggestions, treating this as a design proposal endeavor. The focus is now on presenting a concrete and structured design strategy for the app, which I\'ll call \"CaptionDrive\". The plan is to clearly outline this proposal, and then offer to implement the requested design changes. I am developing an initial overhaul strategy.\n\n\n**Refining Visual Aesthetics**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the aesthetic overhauls, thinking about the contrast between \"Warm Editorial Light & Cool Obsidian Dark\" palettes. I\'m focusing on defining light and dark mode specifications; the light mode needs off-white, dark slate, and subtle borders, while the dark mode needs obsidian slate with indigo highlights. I\'m refining workspace designs.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "Here is a design concept to transform **CaptionDrive** into an editorial, high-end content creator studio:\n\n---\n\n### 1. **\"Studio Minimalist\" Palette & Theme**\n* **Light Theme (\"Off-White Studio\")**:\n  * **Background**: Clean off-white backdrop (`#F9FAFB` or `#F4F5F7`) instead of flat white.\n  * **Cards & Containers**: Clean crisp white surfaces with ultra-thin hairline borders (`border-gray-200/60`), zero bright gradients, and 2-3px soft elevation shadows.\n  * **Accents**: Deep charcoal/black (`#111827`) for primary buttons and high-contrast typography, paired with subtle indigo/slate status tags.\n* **Dark Theme (\"Obsidian Slate\")**:\n  * **Background**: Deep obsidian canvas (`#0B0F17`) with crisp dark-slate card surfaces (`#111827`).\n  * **Borders**: Subdued 1px borders (`border-slate-800/80`) to eliminate harsh contrast lines.\n\n---\n\n### 2. **Split-Screen AI Caption Studio (Modal & View)**\n* **Side-by-Side Canvas**:\n  * **Left Side**: Visual Media Player/Viewer with computer vision tag badges (Detected Objects, Scene Location, Dominant Colors, Video Transcript snippet).\n  * **Right Side**: Controls for **Platform**, **Tone**, **Length**, and **Target Audience**, followed by interactive tabbed variations.\n* **Live Social Post Previews**:\n  * Preview how the generated caption looks inside a mockup of **Instagram**, **LinkedIn**, **X (Twitter)**, or **Facebook** feeds with profile avatars, likes counter, and character limit indicators.\n\n---\n\n### 3. **Bento Library Grid & View Options**\n* **Fluid Grid & Compact List Toggles**:\n  * Allow users to switch between a visual **Bento Grid** (aspect ratio preserved thumbnail cards) and a high-density **Table List View** for managing large Drive folders.\n* **Filter Bar**:\n  * Folder pill filters (e.g. *All*, *YouTube Clips*, *Product Shots*, *Reels*), file type filter (*Images* vs. *Videos*), and AI search status.\n\n---\n\n### 4. **Publishing & Approval Dashboard**\n* **Clean KanBan Approval Pipeline**:\n  * A 3-stage column workflow for social publishing: **Draft Captions** \342\206\222 **Awaiting Approval** \342\206\222 **Published Live**.\n* **Connected Accounts Hub**:\n  * Clean status badges for Instagram, LinkedIn, X, and Facebook with one-click OAuth setup and credential keys modal.\n\n---\n\n### Next Steps\nWould you like me to go ahead and implement this refreshed **Studio Minimalist** redesign across the entire application?"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 54001087
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
  metadata {
    created_at {
      seconds: 1786100031
      nanos: 701821346
    }
    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Caption drive  should feel like a premium SaaS product used by professional content creators\342\200\224not a generic AI tool.\n\nThe inspiration is a combination of:\n\n* Linear\n* Notion\n* Arc Browser\n* Stripe Dashboard\n* Raycast\n* Framer\n\nThe interface should communicate speed, confidence, and simplicity.\n\nEvery screen should have generous whitespace.\n\nAvoid visual clutter.\n\nEvery element must have a purpose.\n\n---\n\n# Overall Style\n\nKeywords\n\n* Premium\n* Minimal\n* Modern\n* Clean\n* Soft\n* Professional\n* Calm\n* AI-first\n* Fast\n\nNever make the UI feel playful or childish.\n\nAvoid oversized gradients.\n\nAvoid excessive animations.\n\nAvoid unnecessary icons.\n\n---\n\n# Color Palette\n\nPrimary Background\n\n#FAFAFA\n\nSidebar\n\n#FFFFFF\n\nCards\n\n#FFFFFF\n\nPrimary Text\n\n#111827\n\nSecondary Text\n\n#6B7280\n\nBorder\n\n#E5E7EB\n\nAccent\n\n#2563EB\n\nSuccess\n\n#16A34A\n\nWarning\n\n#F59E0B\n\nDanger\n\n#DC2626\n\nHover\n\n#F3F4F6\n\n---\n\n# Typography\n\nFont\n\nInter\n\nFallback\n\nSystem UI\n\nHierarchy\n\nH1\n\n36px\nBold\n\nH2\n\n28px\nSemibold\n\nH3\n\n22px\nSemibold\n\nBody\n\n16px\n\nSmall Text\n\n14px\n\nCaption\n\n13px\n\nNever use more than three font weights.\n\n---\n\n# Spacing\n\nEverything should align to an 8px spacing system.\n\nPadding\n\n16px\n24px\n32px\n\nCard Radius\n\n18px\n\nButton Radius\n\n12px\n\nInput Radius\n\n12px\n\nCards should breathe.\n\nNever cram content together.\n\n---\n\n# Shadows\n\nVery soft shadows only.\n\nNo heavy drop shadows.\n\nCards should appear elevated through spacing more than shadows.\n\n---\n\n# Buttons\n\nPrimary\n\nBlue background\n\nWhite text\n\nMedium weight\n\nHover with subtle brightness increase\n\nSecondary\n\nWhite background\n\nGray border\n\nDark text\n\nGhost\n\nTransparent\n\nOnly text\n\n---\n\n# Inputs\n\nRounded\n\nLarge height\n\nSimple borders\n\nFocus state\n\nBlue outline\n\nNo skeuomorphic effects.\n\n---\n\n# Sidebar\n\nFixed left sidebar.\n\nWidth\n\n280px\n\nContains\n\nLogo\n\nDashboard\n\nContent Library\n\nCaption Generator\n\nAI Assistant\n\nCalendar\n\nAnalytics\n\nSettings\n\nBottom\n\nProfile\n\nDark mode toggle\n\n---\n\n# Dashboard\n\nLarge greeting\n\nQuick statistics\n\nUpcoming scheduled posts\n\nRecent uploads\n\nSuggested captions\n\nLatest AI activity\n\nEverything displayed using clean cards.\n\nNo crowded widgets.\n\n---\n\n# Content Library\n\nPinterest-inspired responsive grid.\n\nLarge thumbnails.\n\nHover reveals actions.\n\nSearch at top.\n\nAdvanced filters.\n\nInfinite scrolling.\n\n---\n\n# Upload Screen\n\nLarge centered upload area.\n\nSupport\n\nDrag & Drop\n\nGoogle Drive\n\nDropbox\n\nOneDrive\n\nProgress indicator.\n\nBeautiful upload animations.\n\n---\n\n# AI Caption Generator\n\nSplit layout.\n\nLeft\n\nMedia preview.\n\nRight\n\nGenerated caption.\n\nBelow caption\n\nRegenerate\n\nChange Tone\n\nShorter\n\nLonger\n\nProfessional\n\nFunny\n\nLuxury\n\nEducational\n\nInspirational\n\nButtons should appear as elegant pills.\n\n---\n\n# Calendar\n\nModern monthly calendar.\n\nScheduled posts shown as colored pills.\n\nClicking opens post preview.\n\nDrag and drop scheduling.\n\n---\n\n# Analytics\n\nMinimal charts.\n\nLarge numbers.\n\nTop performing content.\n\nEngagement trends.\n\nPosting frequency.\n\nBest posting time.\n\nEverything simple.\n\n---\n\n# Cards\n\nCards should have\n\n18px radius\n\n24px padding\n\nSmall shadow\n\nGenerous spacing\n\nConsistent typography\n\n---\n\n# Icons\n\nUse Lucide icons only.\n\nNo emoji.\n\nConsistent stroke width.\n\n---\n\n# Motion\n\nAnimations should feel like Linear.\n\nDuration\n\n150\342\200\223250ms\n\nFade\n\nScale\n\nSlide\n\nNo bouncing.\n\nNo exaggerated motion.\n\n---\n\n# Empty States\n\nEvery empty state should include\n\nIllustration\n\nHelpful message\n\nPrimary CTA\n\nSecondary link\n\n---\n\n# Loading\n\nSkeleton loaders.\n\nProgress bars.\n\nNever show blank pages.\n\n---\n\n# AI Experience\n\nThe AI should feel proactive.\n\nInstead of saying\n\n\"Generate Caption\"\n\nSay\n\n\"What would you like to create today?\"\n\nProvide smart suggestions.\n\nShow recent prompts.\n\nShow recommended actions.\n\n---\n\n# Creator Experience\n\nEvery interaction should reduce friction.\n\nThe user should never feel overwhelmed.\n\nComplex features should be progressively disclosed.\n\nThe interface should always guide the next action.\n\n---\n\n# Mobile\n\nResponsive first.\n\nBottom navigation.\n\nFloating action button for uploads.\n\nCards become stacked.\n\nSidebar becomes drawer.\n\n---\n\n# Accessibility\n\nMinimum contrast ratio WCAG AA.\n\nKeyboard navigation.\n\nVisible focus states.\n\nARIA labels.\n\nScreen reader friendly.\n\n---\n\n# Visual Quality Rules\n\nNever use default Material UI layouts.\n\nNever use crowded dashboards.\n\nNever stretch components edge-to-edge.\n\nPrefer whitespace over decoration.\n\nUse consistent spacing everywhere.\n\nMaintain visual hierarchy.\n\nEvery page should look polished enough to be showcased in a premium product gallery.\n\nThe application should look comparable to products from Linear, Notion, Framer, Vercel, and Stripe rather than a typical AI-generated dashboard."
    items {
      text: "Caption drive  should feel like a premium SaaS product used by professional content creators\342\200\224not a generic AI tool.\n\nThe inspiration is a combination of:\n\n* Linear\n* Notion\n* Arc Browser\n* Stripe Dashboard\n* Raycast\n* Framer\n\nThe interface should communicate speed, confidence, and simplicity.\n\nEvery screen should have generous whitespace.\n\nAvoid visual clutter.\n\nEvery element must have a purpose.\n\n---\n\n# Overall Style\n\nKeywords\n\n* Premium\n* Minimal\n* Modern\n* Clean\n* Soft\n* Professional\n* Calm\n* AI-first\n* Fast\n\nNever make the UI feel playful or childish.\n\nAvoid oversized gradients.\n\nAvoid excessive animations.\n\nAvoid unnecessary icons.\n\n---\n\n# Color Palette\n\nPrimary Background\n\n#FAFAFA\n\nSidebar\n\n#FFFFFF\n\nCards\n\n#FFFFFF\n\nPrimary Text\n\n#111827\n\nSecondary Text\n\n#6B7280\n\nBorder\n\n#E5E7EB\n\nAccent\n\n#2563EB\n\nSuccess\n\n#16A34A\n\nWarning\n\n#F59E0B\n\nDanger\n\n#DC2626\n\nHover\n\n#F3F4F6\n\n---\n\n# Typography\n\nFont\n\nInter\n\nFallback\n\nSystem UI\n\nHierarchy\n\nH1\n\n36px\nBold\n\nH2\n\n28px\nSemibold\n\nH3\n\n22px\nSemibold\n\nBody\n\n16px\n\nSmall Text\n\n14px\n\nCaption\n\n13px\n\nNever use more than three font weights.\n\n---\n\n# Spacing\n\nEverything should align to an 8px spacing system.\n\nPadding\n\n16px\n24px\n32px\n\nCard Radius\n\n18px\n\nButton Radius\n\n12px\n\nInput Radius\n\n12px\n\nCards should breathe.\n\nNever cram content together.\n\n---\n\n# Shadows\n\nVery soft shadows only.\n\nNo heavy drop shadows.\n\nCards should appear elevated through spacing more than shadows.\n\n---\n\n# Buttons\n\nPrimary\n\nBlue background\n\nWhite text\n\nMedium weight\n\nHover with subtle brightness increase\n\nSecondary\n\nWhite background\n\nGray border\n\nDark text\n\nGhost\n\nTransparent\n\nOnly text\n\n---\n\n# Inputs\n\nRounded\n\nLarge height\n\nSimple borders\n\nFocus state\n\nBlue outline\n\nNo skeuomorphic effects.\n\n---\n\n# Sidebar\n\nFixed left sidebar.\n\nWidth\n\n280px\n\nContains\n\nLogo\n\nDashboard\n\nContent Library\n\nCaption Generator\n\nAI Assistant\n\nCalendar\n\nAnalytics\n\nSettings\n\nBottom\n\nProfile\n\nDark mode toggle\n\n---\n\n# Dashboard\n\nLarge greeting\n\nQuick statistics\n\nUpcoming scheduled posts\n\nRecent uploads\n\nSuggested captions\n\nLatest AI activity\n\nEverything displayed using clean cards.\n\nNo crowded widgets.\n\n---\n\n# Content Library\n\nPinterest-inspired responsive grid.\n\nLarge thumbnails.\n\nHover reveals actions.\n\nSearch at top.\n\nAdvanced filters.\n\nInfinite scrolling.\n\n---\n\n# Upload Screen\n\nLarge centered upload area.\n\nSupport\n\nDrag & Drop\n\nGoogle Drive\n\nDropbox\n\nOneDrive\n\nProgress indicator.\n\nBeautiful upload animations.\n\n---\n\n# AI Caption Generator\n\nSplit layout.\n\nLeft\n\nMedia preview.\n\nRight\n\nGenerated caption.\n\nBelow caption\n\nRegenerate\n\nChange Tone\n\nShorter\n\nLonger\n\nProfessional\n\nFunny\n\nLuxury\n\nEducational\n\nInspirational\n\nButtons should appear as elegant pills.\n\n---\n\n# Calendar\n\nModern monthly calendar.\n\nScheduled posts shown as colored pills.\n\nClicking opens post preview.\n\nDrag and drop scheduling.\n\n---\n\n# Analytics\n\nMinimal charts.\n\nLarge numbers.\n\nTop performing content.\n\nEngagement trends.\n\nPosting frequency.\n\nBest posting time.\n\nEverything simple.\n\n---\n\n# Cards\n\nCards should have\n\n18px radius\n\n24px padding\n\nSmall shadow\n\nGenerous spacing\n\nConsistent typography\n\n---\n\n# Icons\n\nUse Lucide icons only.\n\nNo emoji.\n\nConsistent stroke width.\n\n---\n\n# Motion\n\nAnimations should feel like Linear.\n\nDuration\n\n150\342\200\223250ms\n\nFade\n\nScale\n\nSlide\n\nNo bouncing.\n\nNo exaggerated motion.\n\n---\n\n# Empty States\n\nEvery empty state should include\n\nIllustration\n\nHelpful message\n\nPrimary CTA\n\nSecondary link\n\n---\n\n# Loading\n\nSkeleton loaders.\n\nProgress bars.\n\nNever show blank pages.\n\n---\n\n# AI Experience\n\nThe AI should 