    thinking: "**Reviewing Implementation Success**\n\nI\'m pleased to share that both the `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` steps have completed successfully, with no errors reported. This provides an excellent foundation to create a concise, professional design summary for the user. I\'ve now turned my attention to clearly articulating the design, ensuring it\'s accessible and devoid of technical language. Key design inspirations include Linear, Stripe Dashboard, Notion, and Ray.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed the complete redesign of **CaptionDrive**, transforming it into a high-craft SaaS interface inspired by Linear, Notion, and Stripe Dashboard.\n\n### **Design & Architectural Highlights**\n\n- **Refined Aesthetic & Color Palette**:\n  - **Clean Canvas**: Built on a `#FAFAFA` neutral light background paired with `#FFFFFF` cards, crisp `#E5E7EB` hairline borders, and dark mode support.\n  - **Accent Blue**: Standardized on `#2563EB` accent blue for active navigation, primary action buttons, and highlighted indicators.\n  - **Typography & Geometry**: Clean Inter font hierarchy with `18px` rounded cards, `24px` rounded modals, and `12px` rounded controls and buttons.\n\n- **Uncluttered, High-Confidence Views**:\n  - **Overview Dashboard**: Clean hero banner with quick statistics, recent media assets, and instant caption generation triggers.\n  - **Media Library**: Spacious grid layout with hover states, view toggles, folder chips, and AI natural language search.\n  - **Social Publishing Hub**: Linear-style social media publishing center displaying connected accounts (Instagram, LinkedIn, X, Facebook) with connection modals, post queues, status badges, and direct publishing actions.\n  - **Caption History & Favorites**: High-contrast cards for reviewing, copying, starring, and cross-posting previously generated captions.\n  - **Workspace & Account Settings**: Streamlined integrations panel and theme toggle."
