  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining UI/UX Design**\n\nI\'m deep in the process of analyzing the application\'s needs. I\'m focusing on navigation, page structure, and information hierarchy. I\'m starting to visualize the layout with typography, spacing, and essential UI components. Forms, tables, and modal elements are being fleshed out, and I am also considering states and empty states.\n\n\n**Refining UI Component Specs**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on UI components, specifically buttons and responsive behaviors. The design system is taking shape, but I\'m holding off on coding until the complete specification is finalized. I\'m focusing on defining component interactions and visual style guides. I have to make sure every interaction is perfectly clear!\n\n\n**Structuring the UI System**\n\nI\'m now structuring the complete UI/UX Design System Specification, ensuring logical organization and clarity. I\'ve defined the navigation architecture, outlining the main and mobile navigation structures and the hierarchy of views. I\'m also mapping out the modal hierarchy, including the Caption Generator Modal and the Media Detail Modal, along with others. This system will be easy to expand!\n\n\n**Defining Typography System**\n\nI\'m establishing the core typography system. I\'ve defined font sizes for headings and body text, with precise line heights and weights for visual hierarchy. I\'m focusing on text accessibility, ensuring strict WCAG AA contrast ratios, and I have chosen a 4px/8px linear rhythm for spacing.\n\n\n**Establishing Color Theme Tokens**\n\nI\'m now establishing the color palette and dark/light mode theme tokens. I\'ve defined the root canvas, surface cards, primary accent, and text colors for both modes, ensuring a consistent visual experience. I\'ve also focused on component-specific color assignments, from buttons to form controls, to ensure a cohesive look.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "# UI/UX Design System & Specification: **CaptionDrive**\n\n---\n\n## 1. Executive Summary & Core Philosophy\n\n**CaptionDrive** transforms connected Google Drive media into platform-optimized social media content powered by Gemini AI.\n\n### Architectural & Design Principles\n1. **Utility-First & Zero Noise**: Focus directly on content creation workflows without decorative splash screens or hero marketing clutter.\n2. **Elevated Neutral Palette**: High-contrast, clean light canvas (`#FAFAFA`) and deep obsidian dark canvas (`#0B0F19`) with precise 1px borders for visual structure.\n3. **Harmonious Spatial Grid**: 4px/8px linear spatial rhythm with mathematically nested border radii (`Inner Radius = Outer Radius - Padding`).\n4. **Desktop-First Precision with Mobile Responsiveness**: Fluid multi-column layouts on desktop transitioning to touch-friendly single-column viewports on mobile.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Navigation & Page Hierarchy\n\n```\nCaptionDrive Root Layout\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Fixed Top Header (Brand, Search Bar, Quick Import, Drive Status Badge, Theme Toggle, User Profile)\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Adaptive Navigation Layer\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Desktop Sidebar (Persistent 240px drawer or 72px collapsed rail)\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 Mobile Tab Bar (Horizontal scrolling pills below top bar)\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 Primary View Container\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 1. Dashboard View (/dashboard)\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 2. Drive Media Library (/media)\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 3. Social Publishing & Queue (/social)\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 4. Favorite Assets (/favorites)\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 5. Caption Generation History (/captions)\n    \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 6. Account & Workspace Settings (/settings)\n```\n\n### View Specifications & Purpose\n\n| View | Purpose | Primary Actions |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Dashboard** | Overview of Drive assets, recent captions, and platform publishing metrics. | AI Smart Search trigger, Quick Import, Generate Caption CTA |\n| **Media Library** | Grid/List view of synced Drive photos & videos with folder filters. | Folder filter, Star/Unstar, Open Media Detail, Batch Select |\n| **Social Publishing** | Schedule and cross-post captions to Instagram, LinkedIn, X, and Facebook. | Select platforms, Customize tone, Schedule time, Post Now |\n| **Favorites** | Quick access bookmark hub for starred assets. | Filter by media type, Direct caption generation |\n| **Caption History** | Log of all past generated hooks, bodies, CTAs, and hashtags. | Copy to clipboard, Re-edit, Post to social, Delete entry |\n| **Settings** | Drive integration status, theme toggle, and platform options. | Re-sync Drive, Disconnect account, Theme switch |\n\n### Modal Overlay Hierarchy\n1. **Caption Generator Modal**: AI prompt customization (Tone, Platform, Hooks, CTAs, Hashtags).\n2. **Media Detail Modal**: High-res media preview + Gemini visual & transcript analysis.\n3. **Smart Search Modal**: Natural language AI semantic search over media contents.\n4. **Import Media Asset Modal**: Quick sample presets or manual Drive file URL additions.\n5. **Social Publish Modal**: Multi-channel preview cards and scheduling controls.\n6. **Onboarding Modal**: 2-step setup for Google Drive connectivity.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Typography System\n\nThe typography scale uses the **Major Second (1.125)** ratio for dense UI clarity, set in `Inter` / system sans-serif font stack.\n\n```\nFont Stack: \'Inter\', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, sans-serif\nTracking: -0.011em baseline tight letter spacing\nLine Height: 1.25 for display headers | 1.4 for labels | 1.5 - 1.6 for body text\n```\n\n| Type Role | Font Size | Weight | Tailwind Class | Contrast Requirement | Usage |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Display / H1** | 24px (`1.5rem`) | Bold (700) | `text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight` | \342\211\245 7:1 | View titles, modal primary headers |\n| **Section Title / H2** | 18px-20px | Bold (700) | `text-lg font-bold` | \342\211\245 7:1 | Card group headers, section labels |\n| **Subtitle / H3** | 14px-16px | SemiBold (600) | `text-sm font-semibold` | \342\211\245 4.5:1 | Item titles, modal subheaders |\n| **Body / Base** | 12px-14px | Normal/Medium | `text-xs` / `text-sm` | \342\211\245 4.5:1 | Main descriptions, captions, transcript text |\n| **Caption / Label** | 10px-11px | Bold (700) | `text-[10px]` uppercase | \342\211\245 4.5:1 | Badges, tags, platform chips, timestamps |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Spacing, Borders, & Radius System\n\n### Spatial Grid (8px Rhythm)\n- **Container Outer Padding**: `p-6` (24px) on desktop, `p-4` (16px) on mobile.\n- **Card Inner Spacing**: `p-4` (16px) or `p-5` (20px).\n- **Element Component Gap**: `gap-2` (8px) for tightly coupled controls, `gap-4` (16px) for major sections.\n\n### Border Radius Hierarchy\n- **Outer Shell / Modals**: `rounded-[24px]` (24px)\n- **Primary Content Cards / Views**: `rounded-[18px]` (18px)\n- **Inner Containers / Feature Blocks**: `rounded-xl` (12px)\n- **Control Elements (Buttons, Inputs, Chips)**: `rounded-lg` (8px) to `rounded-xl` (12px)\n- **Avatars / Floating Badges**: `rounded-full`\n\n*Nested Radius Formula*: `Inner Radius = Outer Radius - Padding` (e.g. 18px card outer radius with 6px padding yields a 12px inner radius).\n\n---\n\n## 5. Color Palette & Dark/Light Theme Tokens\n\n| Token Category | Light Mode Value | Dark Mode Value | Purpose / Usage |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Root Background** | `#FAFAFA` (`bg-gray-50`) | `#0B0F19` | Application canvas backdrop |\n| **Surface Card** | `#FFFFFF` (`bg-white`) | `#111622` | Primary cards, modals, sidebars |\n| **Sub-Surface Block** | `#F3F4F6` (`bg-gray-100`) | `#1E2638` | Input fields, code boxes, chip backdrops |\n| **Border Normal** | `#E5E7EB` (`border-gray-200`) | `#1F2937` (`border-slate-800`) | Structural dividing lines |\n| **Text Primary** | `#111827` (`text-gray-900`) | `#F9FAFB` (`text-white`) | Headings, main label text |\n| **Text Muted** | `#6B7280` (`text-gray-500`) | `#9CA3AF` (`text-slate-400`) | Helper text, secondary descriptions |\n| **Accent Primary** | `#2563EB` (`bg-blue-600`) | `#3B82F6` (`bg-blue-500`) | Primary CTA buttons, active state highlights |\n| **Accent Success** | `#059669` (`text-emerald-600`)| `#10B981` | Drive connection status, post confirmation |\n| **Accent Danger** | `#E11D48` (`text-rose-600`) | `#F43F5E` | Delete actions, error banners, favorites |\n\n---\n\n## 6. Component Specs & Interactive States\n\n### 1. Buttons\n- **Primary CTA**: Height `36px` to `40px` (`h-9` / `h-10`), `bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl px-4`.\n  - *States*: Default, Hover (`bg-blue-700`), Active (`scale-95`), Disabled (`opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed`).\n- **Secondary / Ghost**: `bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-200 border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 hover:bg-gray-100`.\n- **Destructive**: `bg-rose-50 text-rose-600 dark:bg-rose-950/80 hover:bg-rose-100 border border-rose-100 dark:border-rose-900/40`.\n\n### 2. Form Controls & Inputs\n- **Text & Search Inputs**: Height `36px` to `44px`, `bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl px-3.5 text-xs`.\n  - *Focus State*: `focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600/20 focus:border-blue-600`.\n\n### 3. Media Cards\n- **Grid Layout**: Aspect ratio 4:3 or square (1:1), 1px solid border, subtle hover transform (`group-hover:scale-105`), top overlay badges (Video duration, File type, Favorite heart trigger), bottom media title & folder info.\n\n### 4. Modals\n- **Backdrop**: `fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-xs z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4`.\n- **Container**: Centered, `max-w-lg` to `max-w-4xl`, max height `90vh` with internal overflow scrolling, rounded `rounded-[24px]`, explicit close button at `top-5 right-5`.\n\n---\n\n## 7. State Handling & Edge Cases\n\n| State Type | UI Representation | Behavioral Rule |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Loading / Skeleton** | Pulsing gray block (`animate-pulse bg-gray-200 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl`) | Display exact dimension skeleton during Drive sync and AI caption generation |\n| **Empty State** | Centered icon container (`w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-800`), title, subtitle, and primary CTA button | Clear, actionable prompt explaining how to add or generate content |\n| **Error / Alert** | Bounded banner with light red/amber backdrop, dark red text, and retry/dismiss button | Provide explicit diagnostic details and a simple retry action |\n| **Success / Confirmation** | Temporary inline toast or badge state with checkmark icon (`CheckCircle2`) | Provide visual feedback without breaking workflow context |\n\n---\n\n## 8. Responsive & Adaptive Breakpoints\n\n- **Mobile Viewport (`< 768px`)**:\n  - Sidebar collapses into top navbar.\n  - Sub-navigation bar displays horizontal scrolling tab pills.\n  - Grid displays 1 column for media cards.\n  - Touch targets guaranteed at minimum `44px x 44px`.\n- **Tablet Viewport (`768px - 1024px`)**:\n  - Grid displays 2 columns for media assets.\n  - Sidebar collapses to icon-only vertical rail (72px width).\n- **Desktop Viewport (`> 1024px`)**:\n  - Full expanded sidebar (240px width).\n  - Grid displays 3 to 4 columns (`grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4`).\n  - Multi-column side-by-side modal panels for media preview & AI insights.\n\n---\n\n### Implementation Readiness\nThis design system specification establishes the structural foundation for CaptionDrive. The app components, dark/light theme tokens, layout geometry, and responsive behaviors strictly align with these defined rules."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 7
      nanos: 650018399
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
